                        "content": "\nBy default, any document submitted to Fincura will be scanned for Income Statement and Balance Sheet information.\n\nThe engine can also be pointed at Tax Returns by setting a statement object with a `form_type` and `tax_year`. Supported tax form types: \n\n```\n{\n    \"borrower_uuid\": \"6e...845ab1d\",\n    \"media_type\": \"application/pdf\",\n    \"statements\": [\n        {\n          \"form_type\": \"1065\"\n          \"tax_year\": 2019\n        }\n      ]\n}\n```\n    \n\n",
